<title>UK: CSFB sets call warrants on Sony Corp.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets call warrants on Sony Corp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston says it has issued 500,000 American-style call warrants, on Sony Corp.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    8,000.00 JPY	    PREMIUM	12.53 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     14.50 CHF		 GEARING	6.58 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 18.FEB.97-18.FEB.99   PAYDATE	17.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  8,220.00 JPY</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
